environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Villa Douglas: Garage & Security Perimeter (Subterranean Bays & Main Gate, Villa Douglas, Seven Hills);
Setting: Subterranean vehicle hangar and fortified main security gateway guarding the estate perimeter;
Factions: DCC Tactical Estate Security (Kaladin Nargathon, Marcus Thornfield), Douglas Family Drivers;
Conflicts: Maintaining rapid emergency extraction readiness vs preventing unauthorized departures;
Society: Strict militarized hierarchy, biological vehicular parking protocol reflecting pack protection lines]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Sharp scent of motor oil, high-octane gasoline, heated rubber, industrial concrete sealant, and metallic weapon oil;
Architecture: Multi-bay subterranean reinforced parking complex, hydraulic vehicle barriers, reinforced steel security booth at exterior wrought-iron gate;
Security & Wards: Thermal reconnaissance drones, undercarriage vehicle scanners, automated bollards, armed DCC sentinels on 24/7 patrol;
Demographics: DCC tactical guards, family members operating personal vehicles (Alyssa's yellow Beetle, Alpha heavy armored SUVs);
Rules & Restrictions: All incoming vehicles undergo full sensor sweep, Omega vehicles parked closest to elevators with Alphas sealing exterior ramps]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Upgraded to military specification by DCC engineers following regional territorial clashes in the late 1990s;
Secrets: Beneath bay 4 lies an emergency underground vehicular escape tunnel tunneling straight into the lower Seven Hills municipal bypass]
